  "title": "About Re:Booth (Re:ブース)",
  "content_html": "<main class=\"p-page\">\n        <div class=\"l-container-fluid\">\n        <ul class=\"c-breadcrumb\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/BreadcrumbList\"><li class=\"c-breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><a itemprop=\"item\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp\"><span itemprop=\"name\" >HOME</span></a><meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"1\" /></li><li class=\"c-breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><span itemprop=\"name\">About Re:Booth</span><meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"2\" /></li></ul>      </div>\n      <section class=\"p-page__header\">\n        <div class=\"l-container-fluid\">\n          <div class=\"p-page__title c-title-sec \">\n            <p class=\"c-text--en js-split\">\n              about            </p>\n            <h1 class=\"c-text--ja p-page__title--fade\">About Re:Booth</h1>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n                                </section>  <div class=\"wp_block-content\">\n    \n<figure class=\"wp-block-video alignwide p-section-video\"><video height=\"1080\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1920 / 1080;\" width=\"1920\" autoplay loop muted src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/rebooth-movie-03.mp4\" playsinline></video></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-stack-wrapper is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<section class=\"wp-block-group pa-pin-section is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-pin-section__image is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium u-media\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1548993609-960x538.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-504\" srcset=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1548993609-960x538.jpeg 960w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1548993609-1920x1076.jpeg 1920w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1548993609-450x252.jpeg 450w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1548993609-768x430.jpeg 768w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1548993609-1536x861.jpeg 1536w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1548993609-2048x1148.jpeg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-pin-section__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-pin-section__text is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading pa-pin-section__title is-decorated-top\">Exhibition booths that maintain design appeal while planning for continuous reuse.</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Many companies that repeatedly exhibit find the burden of building a new booth each time and the post‑event disposal challenges significant.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At Re:Booth, we propose designs that preserve the distinctive design of truss structures while being geared toward continuous reuse. By configuring the booth to be flexibly adjusted to venue conditions and exhibition content, we enable sustainable repeat exhibitions and reduction of waste.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"wp-block-group pa-pin-section is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-pin-section__image is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full u-media\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1382\" height=\"1184\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/99f0a41b0701f79946ae4378f536906f.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-736\" srcset=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/99f0a41b0701f79946ae4378f536906f.jpg 1382w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/99f0a41b0701f79946ae4378f536906f-960x822.jpg 960w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/99f0a41b0701f79946ae4378f536906f-450x386.jpg 450w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/99f0a41b0701f79946ae4378f536906f-768x658.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1382px) 100vw, 1382px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-pin-section__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-pin-section__text is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading pa-pin-section__title is-decorated-top\">Booth Design That Doesn’t End at Construction</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It is not uncommon for exhibition booths to be built, dismantled, and discarded for each exhibition.<br>At Re:Booth, we design from the initial stage with future exhibitions in mind, considering reusable parts and configurations.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"wp-block-group pa-pin-section is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-pin-section__image is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full u-media\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1270\" height=\"1290\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/48e403d22631a800c50fc4f138c38c48.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-738\" srcset=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/48e403d22631a800c50fc4f138c38c48.jpg 1270w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/48e403d22631a800c50fc4f138c38c48-945x960.jpg 945w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/48e403d22631a800c50fc4f138c38c48-443x450.jpg 443w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/48e403d22631a800c50fc4f138c38c48-768x780.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1270px) 100vw, 1270px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-pin-section__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-pin-section__text is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading pa-pin-section__title is-decorated-top\">Leveraging the Flexibility of Truss Structures for Reuse</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Truss structures allow flexible expression of corporate identity and product appeal that are difficult to achieve with standardized booths.<br>Re:Booth aims for a configuration that, while capitalizing on this flexibility, can be easily adjusted to exhibition content and venue conditions.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"wp-block-group pa-pin-section is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-pin-section__image is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium u-media\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/640788444-960x540.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-500\" srcset=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/640788444-960x540.jpeg 960w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/640788444-1920x1081.jpeg 1920w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/640788444-450x253.jpeg 450w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/640788444-768x432.jpeg 768w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/640788444-1536x864.jpeg 1536w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/640788444-2048x1153.jpeg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-pin-section__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-pin-section__text is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading pa-pin-section__title is-decorated-top\">Support Designed With Future Exhibitions in Mind</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We provide end‑to‑end support from inquiry and hearing, planning and quotation, production and procurement, to on‑site execution.<br>You can consult with us not only on one‑off booth production but also on future exhibition planning and operational methods.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide p-page-column-box is-style-sticky l-block is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box__header is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\"><div class=\"lazyblock-section-title-ymcsz wp-block-lazyblock-section-title\"><hgroup class=\"c-title-sec is-dark\">\n\n  <p class=\"c-text--en js-split g-fall-text\">client</p>\n\n  <h2 class=\"c-text--ja\">Clients</h2>\n\n</hgroup></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\"><div class=\"lazyblock-client-list-ZwtcDi wp-block-lazyblock-client-list\">              <div class=\"p-client-list\">\n                                          <div class=\"p-client-item\">\n              <div class=\"u-media\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/logo.png\" alt=\"W2 Co., Ltd.\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </div>\n              <p>W2 Co., Ltd.</p>\n            </div>\n                                                    <div class=\"p-client-item\">\n              <div class=\"u-media\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/logo.svg\" alt=\"National Institute of Maritime, Port and Aviation Technology\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </div>\n              <p>National Institute of Maritime, Port and Aviation Technology</p>\n            </div>\n                                                    <div class=\"p-client-item\">\n              <div class=\"u-media\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/